# Serialization Format

- Unless explicitly requested, do not preserve backwards compatibility with old FSCN serialization formats.
- When changing serialized scene structs or layout, keep the code clean and store the new values directly.
- Prefer bumping the FSCN magic/version and failing fast on older files over adding upgrade shims, legacy structs, or compatibility branches.
